              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.20.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 20:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " basi Daudi akawaambia hao Wagibeoni, Niwatendee nini? Na kwa tendo gani nifanye upatanisho, mpate kuubariki urithi wa BWANA? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hao Wagibeoni wakamwambia, Si jambo la fedha wala dhahabu lililo kati ya sisi na Sauli, au nyumba yake; wala si juu yetu kumwua mtu yeyote katika Israeli. Akasema, Mtakayonena, ndiyo nitakayowatendea ninyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamwambia mfalme, Yule mtu aliyetupoteza, na kutufanyia shauri la kutuharibu, tusikae katika mipaka yoyote ya Israeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
